mmunity for others to follow\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n143:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"bgJ6pzhIQTOg\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"e232k7TR361D\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"₳100,000\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n144:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"pS4rOvDTG0in\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"EEYJonV9Ttzg\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Budget summit\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n1f5:T551,Budget ProcessTransparency to DReps:\n* Provide DReps with a comprehensive overview of the budget process and opportunities to provide direct feedback to the budget committee.\n2. DRep Event for Financial Presentation:\n* Organize an event and digital presentation session for all DReps, designed to deliver a detailed overview of the financial landscape.\n* Key elements supplied by Deliver Assurance include budget performance, forecasting, and strategic financial planning tailored to each DRep's area of responsibility.\n* Encourage interactive discussions to address specific queries and provide clarity on any financial concerns.\n3. Budget Committee Travel:\n* Travel logistics for the Budget Committee, including key locations for in-person meetings, if necessary, as part of the summit preparation and to support their participation.\n4. Budget Tooling and Resources:\n* Implement and introduce new or updated budget management tools and platforms to streamline tracking, analysis, and forecasting.\n* Offer hands-on training for DReps to ensure proficiency with the tools, ensuring all team members can easily access and utilize"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," financial data.\n* Continuously assess and improve tooling based on feedback to enhance budget accuracy, transparency, and efficiency.\n\nNote: the above should be done in collaboration with all other committees to remove duplications.145:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"27uZ5R8PlyVm\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"K13Bua70KFJU\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"$1f5\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n146:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"61D2DJcvljvk\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"X1F5AlHtxirf\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Provides the community the opportunity to get involved in the budget process, along with engaging with them at appropriate events.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n147:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left