and the broader governance structure from unforeseen complications. Critically, this budget item is a contingency measure, used only if and when new members require legal assistance.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n14f:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\","])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\"HLHC8BKfhhNC\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"lWZbaYWlpuJA\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Support CC members in setup\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n150:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"C0c1P39B8eja\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"LSBMcGMicphh\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"₳160,000\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n151:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"e99LOyGjjG9T\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"UUdhLnEd019H\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"CC Contributor Reimbusement\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"152:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"WDbZ4xQAhWuq\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"TO8fUQQnsYx8\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"This budget line item supports a set of operational and technical roles that ensure the Constitutional Committee (CC) can effectively fulfill its governance responsibilities. These roles provide administrative, logistical, and technical support to maintain smooth decision-making processes and secure technical participation. Key responsibilities include coordinating meetings, managing documentation, tracking governance decisions, and facilitating communication between the CC and other governance bodies. On the technical side, these roles ensure the security and functionality of cryptographic infrastructure, oversee multisig signing processes, and maintain the technical tools required for governance operations. By combining administrative and technical expertise, this support structure ensures that the CC can operate efficiently, transparently, and securely within Cardano’s governance framework.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"153:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"jamsZl7HyeEq\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"C0EM4PEXeBi6\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Support for the CC community\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n154:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"ILZeU9lB3hDO\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"tUkjRVHD7Ur6\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"₳510,000\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n155:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"ovqVMztaCu05\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"cxShU8nkSkfc\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Legal CC advisory\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n156:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"T2mB68Y8jpmD\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"8b8te7ebTWNK\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"This legal advisory fund ensures that the Constitutional Committee (CC) can access professional counsel for any governance, compliance, or liability concerns arising from their collective decisions. As the CC oversees critical on-chain governance processes, obtaining expert legal opinions may be vital to uphold transparency and mitigate risk. By making this reserve available as a contingency only when specific legal guidance is required, we both manage costs responsibly and protect the committee’s ability to act with full legal clarity. Ultimately, this fund safeguards the integrity and accountability of the constitutional governance process.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n157:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"KMvxXwKZgBeJ\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"lLCv03a4LONA\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Support for the CC community\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n158:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"QS109pZMQWH8\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 has-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 print:break-inside-avoid w-full max-w-[unset] text-start self-start justify-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"WUtVhcN46PnV\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$3\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"₳700,000\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n159:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"blocks w-full space-y-2 lg:space-y-3 leading-normal self-center **:text-left text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"N15Js775JMyI\",{\"className\":\"has-[.button,input]:flex has-[.button,input]:flex-wrap has-[.button,input]:gap-2 h"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"as-[.button,input]:items-center decoration-primary/6 pri